top me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk! Get ready to fight!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"A91","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"MP7","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"A-91","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You there, the pink-haired one! Put your gun down! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you point it at me again I'll set everything off!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"MP7","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AA-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Crap, there's a devil up ahead and the deep blue sea beyond... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Can we try for an assault?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"97type","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Type 97","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There's no reasoning with this woman, if we try to launch an attack, she'll set everything off..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"97type","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"While they have been arguing, the enemy has drawn close. The sound of heavy footfalls echoes up and down the street, resounding in everyone's eardrums. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"A-91 hears it too, but she's too focused on the four people in front of her to look away."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"MP7","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_weapon_reload","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Gr MP7","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You idiot, this is the last time I'm going to warn you. Let's put our differences aside for now and take care of that guy before we argue about what belongs to who!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"A91","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"MP7","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"A-91","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Who are you calling an idiot?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"A91","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Explode","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A red blast circle appears below A-91's feet, as if to prove Gr MP7's words. Although A-91 takes cover immediately, she still loses a big chunk of HP. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As she watches her HP bar shrink, A-91's alcohol-soaked patience finally snaps."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"A91","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"A-91","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AK-47 (hic) abandoned me here and put me in a humiliating situation, then you tried to pull a cheap stunt on me, and now even the enemy's bullying me! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If I can't enjoy the game, then neither will you! Time to die!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M1903","expression":11,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Springfield","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait, we can give you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"A91","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"M1903","expression":11,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"A-91","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shut up! I'm not playing this stupid game anymore!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"A91","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Gunfight","raw":"SE2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A-91 opens fire without letting Springfield finish. Springfield throws herself aside, and the bullets all strike the explosives piled up behind 